{"version":1,"content":"<p>80年代有「宅男女神」之稱的朱寶意（Emily），年輕時在台灣以模特兒身份出道，其後隻身赴港發展，憑藉清純氣質迅速走紅。</p><p>不過最令人印象深刻的作品，莫過於神作《英雄本色》系列，她在戲中飾演張國榮的女友Jackie，清純形象深入民心。</p><p>朱寶意淡出</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T14:22:13.501294+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T14:01:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T14:18:23.213963+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T14:18:23.213963+00:00","content_hash":"d595112d91d9bcc3e4070dfe5515161f502157a9ec14ce14f354d815901cae99","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}